(68, 38, 'ANABOLIC WHEY 80 - ProActive | 2.25Kg', 'produits/September2025/udAN3lckUJXn3T3i0C0T.webp', 974, NULL, 300, NULL, 259, '<h1 data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"763\">ANABOLIC WHEY 80 &ndash; ProActive | 2,25 kg</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"830\"><strong data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"830\">Whey pure 80 % + BCAA + Glutamine | Prot&eacute;ine musculation s&egrave;che</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"1060\">ANABOLIC WHEY 80 de <strong data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"875\">ProActive Nutrition</strong> est une <strong data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"929\">prot&eacute;ine whey hautement concentr&eacute;e (80 %)</strong>, con&ccedil;ue pour soutenir la <strong data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"978\">prise de muscle sec</strong>, la <strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1008\">d&eacute;finition musculaire</strong> et la <strong data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1059\">r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration rapide apr&egrave;s l\'entra&icirc;nement</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1277\">Formul&eacute;e pour les athl&egrave;tes exigeants, cette whey associe <strong data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1160\">prot&eacute;ines pures &agrave; assimilation rapide</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1181\">BCAA essentiels</strong>, et <strong data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1199\">glutamine</strong> pour stimuler la synth&egrave;se des prot&eacute;ines et limiter le catabolisme musculaire.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1310\">✅&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1308\">Avantages cl&eacute;s</strong> :</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1747\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1384\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1384\">🔸 <strong data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1354\">80 % de prot&eacute;ines de whey purifi&eacute;e</strong> pour construire du muscle sec</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1496\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1496\">🔸 <strong data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1437\">BCAA naturels (leucine, isoleucine, valine)</strong> pour am&eacute;liorer la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration et pr&eacute;venir les courbatures</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1565\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1565\">🔸 <strong data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1523\">Glutamine ajout&eacute;e</strong> pour acc&eacute;l&eacute;rer la r&eacute;g&eacute;n&eacute;ration musculaire</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1613\">🔸 <strong data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1613\">Faible en sucre et en mati&egrave;res grasses</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1673\">🔸 Digestion facile avec <strong data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1663\">enzymes digestives</strong> int&eacute;gr&eacute;es</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1747\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1747\">🔸 Disponible en <strong data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1716\">saveurs d&eacute;licieuses</strong> (vanille, chocolat, fraise...)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1777\">🎯&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1775\">Id&eacute;al pour</strong> :</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1977\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1826\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1826\">Sportifs en <strong data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1826\">p&eacute;riode de s&egrave;che ou d&eacute;finition</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1890\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1890\">Personnes cherchant une <strong data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1890\">prot&eacute;ine rapide post-entra&icirc;nement</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1977\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1977\">Programmes de <strong data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1935\">prise de masse contr&ocirc;l&eacute;e</strong> ou perte de graisse sans perdre de muscle</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1984\" da