(174, 21, 'GLUTAMINE 500G – REAL PHARM', 'produits/September2023/lVaOO5XSdQOYqfoP9blG.webp', 71, NULL, 130, NULL, 109, '<h2 class=\"\" data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"518\">GLUTAMINE 500G &ndash; REAL PHARM</h2>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"596\"><strong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"596\">R&eacute;cup&eacute;ration Musculaire, Renforcement Immunitaire et Performance Optimale</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"977\">La <strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"633\">Glutamine 500g de Real Pharm</strong> est un compl&eacute;ment incontournable pour les athl&egrave;tes et pratiquants de musculation souhaitant <strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"768\">optimiser leur r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration musculaire</strong>, <strong data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"808\">renforcer leur syst&egrave;me immunitaire</strong> et <strong data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"853\">pr&eacute;server leur masse musculaire s&egrave;che</strong>. Cette formule ultra-pure vous apporte une dose efficace de L-glutamine micronis&eacute;e, facilement assimilable par l&rsquo;organisme.</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1016\">🔬 Qu&rsquo;est-ce que la L-Glutamine ?</h3>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1125\">La <strong data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1033\">glutamine</strong> est l&rsquo;acide amin&eacute; le plus abondant dans le corps humain. Elle joue un r&ocirc;le essentiel dans :</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1343\">\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1177\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1177\">la <strong data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1176\">r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration musculaire post-entra&icirc;nement</strong>,</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1237\">la <strong data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1211\">r&eacute;duction du catabolisme</strong> (d&eacute;gradation musculaire),</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1278\">le <strong data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1277\">soutien du syst&egrave;me immunitaire</strong>,</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1343\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1343\">l\'am&eacute;lioration de la <strong data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1342\">digestion et de la sant&eacute; intestinale</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1401\">💪 Les Bienfaits de la GLUTAMINE 500G &ndash; REAL PHARM :</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1629\">\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1445\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1445\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1445\">Acc&eacute;l&egrave;re la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration musculaire</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1490\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1490\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1490\">R&eacute;duit la fatigue et les courbatures</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1530\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1530\">Renforce le syst&egrave;me immunitaire</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1573\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1573\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1573\">Soutient la synth&egrave;se des prot&eacute;ines</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1629\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1629\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1629\">Prot&egrave;ge la masse musculaire en p&eacute;riode de s&egrave;che</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1676\">📦 Format &eacute;conomique et dosage pratique :</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1838\">\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1724\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1724\"><strong data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1698\">Conditionnement</strong> : 500 g de glutamine pure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1769\"><strong data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1738\">Portion</strong> : Environ 100 doses (5 g/dose)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1838\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1838\"><strong data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1781\">Ar&ocirc;me</strong> : Sans go&ucirc;t (parfait &agrave; m&eacute;langer avec votre whey ou BCAA)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1861\">🏋️&zwj;♂️ Pour qui ?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"2067\">\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1934\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1934\">Les pratiquants de <strong data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1898\">musculation</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1912\">crossfit</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1921\">MMA</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1934\">fitness</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"2010\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"2010\">Les sportifs en <strong data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1971\">phase de s&egrave;che</strong> ou de <strong data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2010\">pr&eacute;paration physique intense</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2067\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2067\">Ceux en <strong data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2048\">p&eacute;riode de r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration</strong> ou de <strong data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2067\">blessure</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2096\">🔍 Mode d&rsquo;utilisation :</h3>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2210\">Prendre <strong data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2125\">5 g (1 cuill&egrave;re)</strong> apr&egrave;s l\'entra&icirc;nement ou avant le coucher. Peut aussi &ecirc;tre consomm&eacute;e &agrave; jeun le matin.</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2277\">✅ Pourquoi Acheter GLUTAMINE REAL PHARM sur Protein.tn ?</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2428\">\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2315\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2315\">💯 <strong data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2315\">Produit original et certifi&eacute;</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2360\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2360\">🚀 <strong data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2341\">Livraison rapide</strong> partout en Tunisie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2385\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2385\">💸 <strong data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2385\">Prix imbattable</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2428\">\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2428\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2428\">Paiement s&eacute;curis&eacute; &amp; stock limit&eacute;</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2574\">🔥 Commandez maintenant votre&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2500\">GLUTAMINE 500G &ndash; REAL PHARM</strong> sur <strong data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2519\">Protein.tn</strong> et offrez &agrave; votre corps la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration qu&rsquo;il m&eacute;rite !</h3>\r\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2725\">✅ <strong data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2723\">FAQ pour produit (si applicable)</strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2847\">Voici quelques id&eacute;es de questions/r&eacute;ponses &agrave; int&eacute;grer en bas de la page produit pour le <strong data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2845\">GLUTAMINE 500G &ndash; REAL PHARM</strong> :</p>\r\n<h4 class=\"\" data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2920\"><strong data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2920\">Q1 : Quand devrais-je prendre la Glutamine 500g &ndash; Real Pharm ?</strong></h4>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"3093\"><strong data-start=\"2921\" data-end=\"2928\">R :</strong> Il est recommand&eacute; de prendre 5 g de Glutamine apr&egrave;s l\'entra&icirc;nement ou avant de dormir pour acc&eacute;l&eacute;rer la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration musculaire et renforcer le syst&egrave;me immunitaire.</p>\r\n<h4 class=\"\" data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3182\"><strong data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3182\">Q2 : Est-ce que la Glutamine peut &ecirc;tre utilis&eacute;e pendant une p&eacute;riode de s&egrave;che ?</strong></h4>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3335\"><strong data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3190\">R :</strong> Oui, la glutamine est parfaite pour maintenir la masse musculaire pendant une s&egrave;che, car elle r&eacute;duit le catabolisme et soutient la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration.</p>\r\n<h4 class=\"\" data-start=\"3337\" data-end=\"3429\"><strong data-start=\"3342\" data-end=\"3429\">Q3 : La Glutamine 500g &ndash; Real Pharm est-elle adapt&eacute;e &agrave; tous les types de sportifs ?</strong></h4>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3430\" data-end=\"3605\"><strong data-start=\"3430\" data-end=\"3437\">R :</strong> Oui, cette glutamine est id&eacute;ale pour les pratiquants de musculation, de fitness, de crossfit ou d\'autres sports intenses o&ugrave; la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration musculaire est essentielle.</p>\r\n<h4 class=\"\" data-start=\"3607\" data-end=\"3663\"><strong data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3663\">Q4 : Combien de doses contient ce pot de 500g ?</strong></h4>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3787\"><strong data-start=\"3664\" data-end=\"3671\">R :</strong> Ce pot de 500g contient environ 100 doses de 5g, vous permettant de profiter d\'une suppl&eacute;mentation de longue dur&eacute;e.</p>', 1, NULL