t=\"239\" data-end=\"255\">Serious Mass</strong> de <strong data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"280\">Optimum Nutrition</strong> est un <strong data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"314\">gainer ultra-calorique</strong>, con&ccedil;u sp&eacute;cialement pour les personnes ayant du mal &agrave; prendre du poids ou de la masse musculaire.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"435\">✅ Ses avantages :</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"731\">\r\n<li data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"514\">\r\n<p data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"514\">💪 <strong data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"467\">1 250 kcal par portion</strong> (avec eau) &mdash; parfait pour l&rsquo;exc&eacute;dent calorique</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"571\">\r\n<p data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"571\">🍚 <strong data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"551\">252 g de glucides complexes</strong> &mdash; &eacute;nergie prolong&eacute;e</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"634\">\r\n<p data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"634\">🥚 <strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"598\">50 g de prot&eacute;ines</strong> &mdash; pour la reconstruction musculaire</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"676\">\r\n<p data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"676\">💊 Enrichi en <strong data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"676\">vitamines et min&eacute;raux</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"731\">\r\n<p data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"731\">✅ Contient de la <strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"708\">cr&eacute;atine</strong> et de la <strong data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"731\">glutamine</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"872\">👉 Il est recommand&eacute; aux <strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"773\">ectomorphes</strong> ou aux sportifs qui br&ucirc;lent beaucoup de calories et souhaitent <strong data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"871\">prendre de la masse rapidement</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"923\">❓&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"923\">Comment grossir avec Serious Mass ?</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"1066\">Pour <strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"981\">prendre du poids efficacement avec Serious Mass</strong>, il faut combiner <strong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1065\">alimentation riche + entra&icirc;nement + suppl&eacute;mentation coh&eacute;rente</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1099\">📅 Conseils d&rsquo;utilisation :</h3>\r\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\">\r\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1372\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<th data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1109\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Moment</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1129\" data-col-size=\"md\">Dose recommand&eacute;e</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1372\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1187\" data-col-size=\"sm\">🕗 Apr&egrave;s l\'entra&icirc;nement</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1223\">1/2 &agrave; 1 portion avec eau ou lait</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1300\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1246\" data-col-size=\"sm\">🍽️ Entre les repas</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1300\">1 portion pour augmenter les calories journali&egrave;res</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1372\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1322\" data-col-size=\"sm\">🌙 Avant de dormir</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1372\">1/2 portion si vous avez un m&eacute;tabolisme rapide</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\r\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r