084\">Avantages cl&eacute;s :</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1113\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1113\">24 g de prot&eacute;ines par dose</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1155\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1155\">Booster naturel de testost&eacute;rone int&eacute;gr&eacute;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1198\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1198\">Riche en BCAA &amp; acides amin&eacute;s essentiels</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1239\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1239\">Stimule la prise de masse et l&rsquo;&eacute;nergie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1279\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1279\">Favorise la r&eacute;cup&eacute;ration et la libido</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1316\">Go&ucirc;ts d&eacute;licieux, facile &agrave; m&eacute;langer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1344\">📦&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1342\">Format :</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1387\">Pot de <strong data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1364\">1,8 KG</strong> &ndash; Environ <strong data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1387\">60 doses</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1440\">Saveurs : Chocolat, Vanille, Cookies (selon stock)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1483\">🛒&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1483\">Disponible sur Protein.tn</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1646\">Commandez <strong data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1524\">WHEY TESTO MR.X &ndash; V-Shapes</strong> d&egrave;s maintenant sur <a class=\"\" href=\"https://sobitas.tn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-st